{"data":{"featured":{"edges":[{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Integrating cognitive neuroscience and clinical perspectives on metacognitive mechanisms in psychopathology","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/5732439245049443c7ffe546426f6c57/3e1ab/1.png","srcSet":"/static/5732439245049443c7ffe546426f6c57/57a76/1.png 175w,\n/static/5732439245049443c7ffe546426f6c57/f00e6/1.png 350w,\n/static/5732439245049443c7ffe546426f6c57/3e1ab/1.png 700w,\n/static/5732439245049443c7ffe546426f6c57/35a97/1.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/5732439245049443c7ffe546426f6c57/50167/1.avif 175w,\n/static/5732439245049443c7ffe546426f6c57/5a8a9/1.avif 350w,\n/static/5732439245049443c7ffe546426f6c57/bc4f6/1.avif 700w,\n/static/5732439245049443c7ffe546426f6c57/44296/1.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/5732439245049443c7ffe546426f6c57/81b0f/1.webp 175w,\n/static/5732439245049443c7ffe546426f6c57/bfc62/1.webp 350w,\n/static/5732439245049443c7ffe546426f6c57/74bac/1.webp 700w,\n/static/5732439245049443c7ffe546426f6c57/67855/1.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":467}}},"tech":["Seow, T. X.F.","Jelinek, L.","Moritz, S.","Hauser, T. U.","Nature Reviews Psychology (2025)"],"github":null,"external":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s44159-025-00503-4"},"html":"<p>We review advances in metacognitive research and treatments across psychiatric disorders in cognitive neuroscience and clinical disciplines. We highlight their differing conceptualisations and methods, and propose a hierarchical framework that links basic neural computations of self-monitoring with higher-level clinical metacognitive beliefs to provide an integrative path forward.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1038/s44159-025-00503-4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Doi</a> / <a href=\"https://rdcu.be/ePxUG\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Pdf</a></p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"How local and global metacognition shape mental health","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/103f1e1f3e73b1ac2eb8695e36b0c9af/3e1ab/1.png","srcSet":"/static/103f1e1f3e73b1ac2eb8695e36b0c9af/57a76/1.png 175w,\n/static/103f1e1f3e73b1ac2eb8695e36b0c9af/f00e6/1.png 350w,\n/static/103f1e1f3e73b1ac2eb8695e36b0c9af/3e1ab/1.png 700w,\n/static/103f1e1f3e73b1ac2eb8695e36b0c9af/35a97/1.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/103f1e1f3e73b1ac2eb8695e36b0c9af/50167/1.avif 175w,\n/static/103f1e1f3e73b1ac2eb8695e36b0c9af/5a8a9/1.avif 350w,\n/static/103f1e1f3e73b1ac2eb8695e36b0c9af/bc4f6/1.avif 700w,\n/static/103f1e1f3e73b1ac2eb8695e36b0c9af/44296/1.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/103f1e1f3e73b1ac2eb8695e36b0c9af/81b0f/1.webp 175w,\n/static/103f1e1f3e73b1ac2eb8695e36b0c9af/bfc62/1.webp 350w,\n/static/103f1e1f3e73b1ac2eb8695e36b0c9af/74bac/1.webp 700w,\n/static/103f1e1f3e73b1ac2eb8695e36b0c9af/67855/1.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":467}}},"tech":["Seow, T. X.F.*","Rouault, M.*","Gillan, C. M.","Fleming, S. M.","Biological Psychiatry (2021)"],"github":null,"external":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.biopsych.2021.05.013"},"html":"<p>We outline a theoretical framework in which hierarchical levels of metacognition may help identify the role of maladaptive metacognitive evaluation in mental health conditions, particularly when combined with transdiagnostic methods.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.biopsych.2021.05.013\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Doi</a> / <a href=\"/files/2021-05-22-How-local-and-global-metacognition-shape-mental-health.pdf\">Pdf</a></p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Psychiatric symptom dimensions are associated with dissociable shifts in metacognition","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/29c5c13c210ea0d091205b579260617a/3e1ab/1.png","srcSet":"/static/29c5c13c210ea0d091205b579260617a/57a76/1.png 175w,\n/static/29c5c13c210ea0d091205b579260617a/f00e6/1.png 350w,\n/static/29c5c13c210ea0d091205b579260617a/3e1ab/1.png 700w,\n/static/29c5c13c210ea0d091205b579260617a/35a97/1.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/29c5c13c210ea0d091205b579260617a/50167/1.avif 175w,\n/static/29c5c13c210ea0d091205b579260617a/5a8a9/1.avif 350w,\n/static/29c5c13c210ea0d091205b579260617a/bc4f6/1.avif 700w,\n/static/29c5c13c210ea0d091205b579260617a/44296/1.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/29c5c13c210ea0d091205b579260617a/81b0f/1.webp 175w,\n/static/29c5c13c210ea0d091205b579260617a/bfc62/1.webp 350w,\n/static/29c5c13c210ea0d091205b579260617a/74bac/1.webp 700w,\n/static/29c5c13c210ea0d091205b579260617a/67855/1.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":467}}},"tech":["Rouault, M.*","Seow, T.*","Gillan, C. M.","Fleming, S. M.","Biological Psychiatry (2018)"],"github":null,"external":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.biopsych.2017.12.017"},"html":"<p>Using perceptual decision making as a model system, we employed a dimensional computational psychiatry approach to reveal independent relationships between psychopathology and metacognition.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.biopsych.2017.12.017\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Doi</a> / <a href=\"/files/2018-10-15-Psychiatric-symptom-dimensions-are-associated-with-dissociable-shifts-in-metacognition.pdf\">Pdf</a> / <a href=\"/files/2018-10-15-Psychiatric-symptom-supplementary.pdf\">Supplementary Material</a> / <a href=\"https://github.com/metacoglab/RouaultSeowGillanFleming\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Data &#x26; Code</a> / <a href=\"https://github.com/marionrouault/metacognition-task-online\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Task Code</a></p>"}}]}}}